// Townsfolk of Avaricum, by the city's phase.
=== start
[flag breakout_stopped] -> breakout
[flag terrace_fire] -> terrace
[flag avaricum_siege] -> siege
[flag scorched_earth] -> refugees
"Have you seen the wall? Have you seen the forum? Nobody's ever taken Avaricum." They say it like a greeting.
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== refugees
"My cousins are sleeping in our yard. From a village up the river. There isn't a village up the river anymore." They shrug. "The council saved the city. Everyone keeps saying it."
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== siege
"Bread's a silver a loaf and there's none to be had at that. The Romans are worse off. Everyone says the Romans are worse off." They look south anyway.
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== terrace
"They're at the wall. You can see their faces from the gate towers. Somebody said one of them waved." They laugh, badly.
* "Goodbye." -> END

=== breakout
"Don't. Please. Not today." They walk on.
* "Goodbye." -> END
